    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 759838083022857
    m_Localized: Mobilya
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 759838083022858
    m_Localized: Zeminler
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 759838083022859
    m_Localized: Duvarlar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 759838083022860
    m_Localized: "Geni\u015Fletme"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 759838083022861
    m_Localized: "Katalogda ara\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 759838083022862
    m_Localized: "Se\xE7 / \xF6nizle"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 759838083022863
    m_Localized: "Sat\u0131n al"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 759838083022864
    m_Localized: "Sat\u0131n al\u0131nd\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 759838083022865
    m_Localized: Uygula
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 759838083022866
    m_Localized: "Kilitli \u2014 ilerleme gerekli"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 759838083022867
    m_Localized: "E\u015Fyalar\u0131n \xB7 ta\u015F\u0131 / depola"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 759838083022868
    m_Localized: Depoda
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 759838083022869
    m_Localized: "Yerle\u015Fik"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 759838083022870
    m_Localized: Kapat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 759838083022871
    m_Localized: "Sa\u011F fare d\xF6nd\xFCr \xB7 tekerlek yak\u0131nla\u015Ft\u0131r
      \xB7 WASD kayd\u0131r \xB7 B kapat"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 759838083022872
    m_Localized: "D\xF6nd\xFCr [R]"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 759838083022873
    m_Localized: 'Izgara [G]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 759838083022874
    m_Localized: "A\xE7\u0131k"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 759838087217152
    m_Localized: "Kapal\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 759838087217153
    m_Localized: 'Onayla [Enter]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 759838087217154
    m_Localized: "\u0130ptal [Esc]"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 759838087217155
    m_Localized: Depola
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 759838087217156
    m_Localized: "Yerle\u015Fimi geri al"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 759838087217157
    m_Localized: "Ge\xE7erli yer \xB7 yerle\u015Ftirmek i\xE7in t\u0131kla"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 759838087217158
    m_Localized: "Ge\xE7ersiz yer: kullan\u0131labilir alan\u0131n d\u0131\u015F\u0131nda"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 759838087217159
    m_Localized: "Ge\xE7ersiz yer: e\u015Fya \xE7ak\u0131\u015Fmas\u0131 / bo\u015Fluk
      yetersiz"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 759838087217160
    m_Localized: "Giri\u015Fi ve giri\u015F yolunu a\xE7\u0131k tut"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 759838087217161
    m_Localized: "Ziyaret\xE7i yolu kapal\u0131 \u2014 sergi ve tezgah eri\u015Fimini
      koru"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 759838087217162
    m_Localized: "Yan veya arka duvara yak\u0131n yerle\u015Ftir"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 759838087217163
    m_Localized: "Tank se\xE7 \xB7 uyumlu habitat \xB7 yaln\u0131zca taban s\xFCsleri"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 759838087217164
    m_Localized: "Yollar\u0131 a\xE7\u0131k tut \xB7 R d\xF6nd\xFCr \xB7 t\u0131klayarak
      yerle\u015Ftir"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 759838087217165
    m_Localized: "Tank se\xE7"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 759838087217166
    m_Localized: "Bitki / mercan habitat\u0131 uyumsuz"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 759838087217167
    m_Localized: "Tank dekorasyon b\xFCt\xE7esi a\u015F\u0131ld\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 759838087217168
    m_Localized: "D\xFCzenleme reddedildi: sahip uyu\u015Fmuyor"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 759838087217169
    m_Localized: "Bu i\u015Flem zaten uyguland\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 759838087217170
    m_Localized: "Yerle\u015Fim de\u011Fi\u015Fti \u2014 yeniden se\xE7"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 759838087217171
    m_Localized: "Kay\u0131t ba\u015Far\u0131s\u0131z; \xF6nceki durum korundu"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 759838087217172
    m_Localized: "E\u015Fya bulunamad\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 759838087217173
    m_Localized: "\xD6nce bu stili sat\u0131n al"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 759838087217174
    m_Localized: "Yerle\u015Fim kaydedildi"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 759838087217175
    m_Localized: "Yeni galeri a\xE7\u0131ld\u0131 ve kaydedildi"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 761497613926400
    m_Localized: Yetersiz sikke
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940271718400
    m_Localized: Kaptan Finn
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855744
    m_Localized: "[E] Kaptan Finn ile konu\u015F"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855745
    m_Localized: "[E] Hasarl\u0131 tekneyi incele"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855746
    m_Localized: '[E] Tekneye bin'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855747
    m_Localized: 'Tekneden in [E]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855748
    m_Localized: "Kurtar\u0131lmaya De\u011Fer Bir Tekne"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855749
    m_Localized: Tamir malzemelerini topla
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855750
    m_Localized: "S\xFCr\xFCklenmi\u015F odun"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855751
    m_Localized: Hurda metal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855752
    m_Localized: Halat demeti
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855753
    m_Localized: '[E] Odunu topla'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855754
    m_Localized: '[E] Hurda metali topla'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855755
    m_Localized: "[E] Halat\u0131 topla"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855756
    m_Localized: "Selam! K\xFC\xE7\xFCk teknem zor ula\u015Ft\u0131. Onu onarmama
      yard\u0131m eder misin? Bini\u015F noktas\u0131ndan bir bak."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855757
    m_Localized: "\xD6nce tekneyi incele. Sonra neye ihtiyac\u0131 oldu\u011Funu
      belirleyelim."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855758
    m_Localized: "Be\u015F odun, \xFC\xE7 hurda metal ve iki halat yeter. Adan\u0131n
      yollar\u0131na ve k\u0131y\u0131s\u0131na bak."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855759
    m_Localized: "\u0130htiyac\u0131m\u0131z olan her \u015Fey burada! Haydi tekneye
      yeni bir ba\u015Flang\u0131\xE7 yapal\u0131m."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855760
    m_Localized: "Denize haz\u0131r! Tekneye bin ve haritadan Kasaba Adas\u0131'n\u0131
      se\xE7. Yolculu\u011Fu ben hallederim."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855761
    m_Localized: "Yard\u0131m ederim!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855762
    m_Localized: Tekneyi onar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855763
    m_Localized: "Ke\u015Ffe \xE7\u0131kal\u0131m"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855764
    m_Localized: Kapat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855765
    m_Localized: "Beklenmedik bir ziyaret\xE7i\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855766
    m_Localized: "Biraz \xF6zen, yeni bir ba\u015Flang\u0131\xE7"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855767
    m_Localized: "Limandan ayr\u0131l\u0131\u015F"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855768
    m_Localized: "Yeni bir k\u0131y\u0131 bekliyor"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855769
    m_Localized: "Var\u0131\u015F noktas\u0131 haz\u0131rlan\u0131yor\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855770
    m_Localized: 'Atla [Esc]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855771
    m_Localized: "Tekne onar\u0131ld\u0131 \u2014 ada yolculu\u011Fu a\xE7\u0131ld\u0131!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855772
    m_Localized: "Kay\u0131t yap\u0131lamad\u0131. Yeniden dene."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855773
    m_Localized: "Var\u0131\u015F noktas\u0131 a\xE7\u0131lamad\u0131. G\xFCvenle
      iskeleye d\xF6nd\xFCn."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855774
    m_Localized: "Ada Rehberi \xB7 D\xFCnya Haritas\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855775
    m_Localized: "Var\u0131\u015F noktas\u0131n\u0131 onayla ve git"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855776
    m_Localized: Kilitli ada
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855777
    m_Localized: "Herkes haz\u0131r \xB7 Kaptan Finn seni g\xF6t\xFCrecek."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855778
    m_Localized: Yolcular
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855779
    m_Localized: "Buradas\u0131n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855780
    m_Localized: "\xD6nce Kaptan Finn'in teknesini onar."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855781
    m_Localized: "Tekne geli\u015Ftirmesi gerekli."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855782
    m_Localized: "Bu geli\u015Ftirme ileride a\xE7\u0131lacak."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855783
    m_Localized: Yetersiz sikke
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855784
    m_Localized: "Yuva Adas\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855785
    m_Localized: "Kasaba Adas\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855786
    m_Localized: Mercan Koyu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855787
    m_Localized: Sisli Mangrovlar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855788
    m_Localized: "Ayaz F\u0131s\u0131lt\u0131s\u0131 Adas\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855789
    m_Localized: "S\u0131cak yuvan, canl\u0131 akvaryumun ve tan\u0131d\u0131k bal\u0131k
      k\u0131y\u0131n."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855790
    m_Localized: "Dost bir liman, renkli pazar soka\u011F\u0131 ve huzurlu kasaba
      meydan\u0131."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855791
    m_Localized: "S\u0131cak resifler ve yeni bal\u0131klar gelecekteki ke\u015Ffini
      bekliyor."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940317855792
    m_Localized: "Gizemli mangrov a\u011Fa\xE7lar\u0131n\u0131n alt\u0131ndaki gizli
      su yollar\u0131."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940322050048
    m_Localized: "Kar\u0131n ve deniz sisinin dokundu\u011Fu uzak bir k\u0131y\u0131."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940322050049
    m_Localized: "K\u0131y\u0131 Ka\u015Fifi ve Kaptan'\u0131n gelecekteki g\xF6revi
      gerekli."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940322050050
    m_Localized: "Okyanus Yolcusu ve gizli harita ke\u015Ffi gerekli."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940322050051
    m_Localized: "Usta Denizci ve ileri seviye ke\u015Fif gerekli."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940322050052
    m_Localized: Basic Boat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940322050053
    m_Localized: Coastal Explorer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940322050054
    m_Localized: Ocean Voyager
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940322050055
    m_Localized: Master Navigator
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940322050056
    m_Localized: Tamir malzemeleri
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940322050057
    m_Localized: Oyuncular bekleniyor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 763940322050058
    m_Localized: "Var\u0131\u015F noktas\u0131n\u0131 se\xE7"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834910231625728
    m_Localized: Oliver Reed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834910269374464
    m_Localized: Tidal Tackle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834910269374465
    m_Localized: Fishing Equipment Merchant
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834910269374466
    m_Localized: Oliver repairs tackle and teaches patient fishing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834910269374467
    m_Localized: A steady line beats a hurried reel. What are we fishing for today?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834910537809920
    m_Localized: Marina Bloom
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834910537809921
    m_Localized: Shell & Seaweed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834910537809922
    m_Localized: Aquatic Botanist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834910537809923
    m_Localized: Marina grows plants for healthy freshwater and marine exhibits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834910537809924
    m_Localized: A little green turns a glass box into a home. Mind the habitat on
      each plant!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834910802051072
    m_Localized: Rosie Baker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834910802051073
    m_Localized: Saltwind Bakery & Tea House
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834910802051074
    m_Localized: Baker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834910802051075
    m_Localized: Rosie makes the harbor feel like a kitchen shared by friends.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834910802051076
    m_Localized: The kettle is singing. Tell me about your morning by the sea.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834911074680832
    m_Localized: Captain Morris
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834911074680833
    m_Localized: The Sunken Chest
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834911074680834
    m_Localized: Antique Dealer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834911074680835
    m_Localized: Morris collects coastal history, one recovered object at a time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834911074680836
    m_Localized: Every anchor has a story. This one took me three tides to untangle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834911338921984
    m_Localized: Mysterious Gull
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834911338921985
    m_Localized: Gull Market
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834911338921986
    m_Localized: Traveling Night Merchant
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834911338921987
    m_Localized: "Pazartesi ve cuma geceleri 20:00\u201302:00 aras\u0131nda gelen
      sessiz bir t\xFCccar."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834911338921988
    m_Localized: You found me between tides. Pearls and rare shells speak louder
      than Coins.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834911607357440
    m_Localized: Bruno Forge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834911607357441
    m_Localized: Old Mooring Workshop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834911607357442
    m_Localized: Recycler & Salvage Artist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834911607357443
    m_Localized: Bruno gives washed-up materials another useful life.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834911607357444
    m_Localized: Nothing is rubbish until I have tried making a fish out of it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834911871598592
    m_Localized: Iris Shutter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834911871598593
    m_Localized: Pixel & Lens Studio
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834911871598594
    m_Localized: Photographer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834911871598595
    m_Localized: Iris collects moments of island life through her lens.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834911871598596
    m_Localized: Hold that thought. The light on the harbor is lovely right now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834912161005568
    m_Localized: Lily Stitch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834912161005569
    m_Localized: Needle & Sail
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834912161005570
    m_Localized: Tailor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834912161005571
    m_Localized: Lily makes comfortable clothes for rainy walks and sunny docks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834912161005572
    m_Localized: Salt in your hair, a good stitch in your sleeve. That's island fashion.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834912416858112
    m_Localized: Luna Glow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834912416858113
    m_Localized: Glowtide Alchemy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834912416858114
    m_Localized: Bioluminescence Researcher
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834912416858115
    m_Localized: Luna keeps careful notes on luminous marine life.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834912416858116
    m_Localized: Some corals carry their own tiny stars. I study how they shine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834912668516352
    m_Localized: Theo Current
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 834912668516353
