  - m_Id: 839155051823104
    m_Localized: "HARBOR BULLETIN \u2014 Authored report\nHome and Town harbors are
      open. Current skies are clear; dynamic weather arrives in the next milestone.
      Visit rocky shores for different fish. Keep displayed specimens in their tanks
      until you choose to remove them."
